      "message": "Since these are statically declared in the `Vertices` function, they are only going to be initialized once, with whatever `primitiveType` was set on that first SkVertices object.\n\nWhat we would do instead is have 3 RenderSteps and 3 Renderers:\n\n   static const VerticesRenderStep kTrianglesStep{kTriangles_VertexMode};\n   static const Renderer kTriangleVerticesRenderer{\"Vertices[triangles]\", \u0026kTrianglesStep};\n   // repeat for kTrianglesStrp and kTriangleFan.\n   \nThen inside your switch over `vertices-\u003epriv().mode()`, you just return the appropriate renderer.",
